{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / Problem\n`rebar workflow edit` (parser `src/rebar/_cli/_parsers/advanced/workflow.py:73-78`, handler `src/rebar/_cli/_workflow_commands.py:115-116,123-151`) serves a bpmn-js editor from a 2 MB vendored bundle force-included in the wheel (`pyproject.toml:370-373`). ADR 0071 (Proposed) was never implemented. The editor drags a Node 22 toolchain into CI (`.github/workflows/_build-and-test.yml:585-622,629-653`), a `make e2e-deps` target (`Makefile:562-585`), and ~7,000 lines of editor-only Python/JS/tests. Operator decision (2026-09-06): remove it entirely; the engine and `workflow new|validate|run|show|status|result` stay. Cites re-verified on origin/main b97d414b8e2.\n\n## Approach\nDelete editor-only modules and assets; leave the engine untouched. `prompt_library.py` is the sole surviving importer of `prompt_authoring.py` (lazy imports at `prompt_library.py:185,254`), so inline its two helpers there (`_SLUG` `prompt_authoring.py:50`, `_valid_id` `:65-66`, `_atomic_write` `:228-239` wrapping `rebar._store.fsutil.atomic_write`) instead of a new sub-100-LOC module, which module-size policy forbids. Remove the `REBAR_PREVIEW_TIMEOUT` resolver (`src/rebar/_config_resolvers.py:346-358`) with its re-exports (`_config_sources.py:41`, `config.py:82`) and its seam-test entry. Regenerate CLI help/reference/env docs with their generators, never by hand.\n\nKEEP (live non-editor callers): `lint.py`, `lint_refs.py`, `lint_expr.py`, `step_contracts.py`, `render.py`, `errors.WorkflowAssetsUnavailableError` (`llm/errors.py:228`; pinned by `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_error_code_taxonomy_contract.py`), `hatch_build.py`, the `ui` extra. REMOVE: `editor_contracts.py` (only `editor.py`/`editor_server.py` import it), `criterion_preview.py` (callers `editor_server.py`, `scripts/t5c_calibrate.py`, plus the static owned-file entry `tests/scripts/test_llm_seam_clean_heldout.py:53`), `rebar.moddle.json` (only `test_bpmn.py`). CodeQL keeps `javascript` (`codeql.yml:49`, 7 JS files under `infra/terraform/auth/`); only the `:47` comment changes.\n\n## Scope\nDelete (git rm): `src/rebar/llm/workflow/{editor.py,editor_server.py,editor_contracts.py,bpmn.py,criterion_preview.py,prompt_authoring.py,rebar.moddle.json}`; `src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets/`; `tests/e2e/`; `tests/unit/workflow/test_{bpmn,editor,editor_batch,editor_effective_policy,editor_roundtrip,editor_validate,prompt_authoring}.py`; `tests/unit/test_criterion_preview.py`; `tests/unit/test_browser_tier_optout.py`; `scripts/t5c_calibrate.py`.\n\nSource/build edits:\n- `_cli/_parsers/advanced/workflow.py:4` docstring, delete `:73-78`; `_cli/_workflow_commands.py:3` docstring, delete `:115-116` and `_workflow_edit` `:123-151`.\n- `llm/workflow/__init__.py:31,71,85,90` drop bpmn exports; `step_contracts.py:7-8,38,69` docstrings; `llm/errors.py:229` docstring.\n- `llm/prompting/prompt_library.py`: add `import re` + `from rebar._store.fsutil import atomic_write`; define `_PROMPT_ID_SLUG`, `_valid_id`, `_atomic_write` above `_validate_id`; drop both lazy imports; reword comments `:61-67`, `:183-184`, `:249-253`.\n- `_config_resolvers.py:346-358` delete; `_config_sources.py:41`, `config.py:82` drop re-exports.\n- `pyproject.toml:370-373` (comment + artifacts glob), `:382-383,388,403` (`**/node_modules` excludes + comment), `:743` (`e2e` marker).\n- `Makefile:74` drop `e2e-deps` from `.PHONY`, delete `:562-585`.\n- `_build-and-test.yml` delete `:585-622` (comment, setup-node, npm cache) and `:629-653` (e2e-deps guard; keep the `uv sync` lines).\n- `codeql.yml:47` -> `# javascript covers the infra/terraform/auth Lambda sources;`.\n- `scripts/check_criteria_vocabulary.py:58` drop entry; `scripts/check_import_walk.py:88-92` drop the `t5c_calibrate.py` entry (keep `SCRIPTS_SKIPS` as an empty dict).\n- Regenerate `src/rebar/_cli/help/workflow.txt`, `docs/cli-reference.md`, `docs/env-vars.md`; `docs/calibration/T5c_trust_boundary.md:8` mark the reproduce line as removed with the script.\n- `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --update-stale` for the stale `REBAR_PREVIEW_TIMEOUT` and deleted-test rows (required by `tests/unit/test_mechanism_delta.py`).\n\nTest edits:\n- `tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py:1972,2039` drop `\"e2e-deps\"` from both sets.\n- `tests/unit/test_config_resolver_seam.py:64` drop `resolve_preview_timeout`.\n- `tests/scripts/test_llm_seam_clean_heldout.py:53` drop `criterion_preview.py`; update the owned-file count at `:8,36`.\n- `tests/unit/test_execution_mode.py:144-182` drop section 3 (3 editor tests).\n- `tests/unit/test_path_injection_guards.py:114-133` drop the editor test.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_contracts.py:17` import, and the 4 inspector tests at `:77,89,99,263`.\n- `tests/unit/workflow/test_validation_depth.py:209-229` drop the badge test; docstring `:4`.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_workflow_error_codes_dbca.py:118-132` drop the editor test.\n- `tests/unit/metrics/test_scc_module_size_reconciliation_heldout.py:98-99`, `tests/unit/test_check_criteria_vocabulary.py:169` drop editor paths.\n- `tests/interfaces/contracts/test_help_overview_coverage.py:121,211-216`, `tests/unit/test_repo_root_from_package_guard.py:95` rename `editor_assets` fixture dirs to a neutral name.\n- Comments: `tests/unit/test_prompt_library_writes.py:2,258`, `tests/unit/test_prompt_model_module_seam.py:26`.\n\nOut of scope: other docs incl. ADR 0071 status (story dendriform-amethyst-hoopoe); `docs/experiments/**`, `tests/fixtures/**` (historical snapshots); `gate_dispatch.py`. `.github/complexity-baseline.json` is not edited.\n\n## Testing\nRelocated helpers keep their oracle in `tests/unit/test_prompt_library_writes.py` (invalid-id, uppercase-id, and `os.replace` atomicity tests). Removal is proven by absence (parse error, `ModuleNotFoundError`, wheel listing). `make verify` is the CI-equivalent gate.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `rebar workflow edit x.yaml; echo $?` prints a usage error naming `{new,validate,run,show,status,result}` and exits non-zero; `rebar workflow --help` does not contain `edit`.\n- [ ] `python -c \"import rebar.llm.workflow as w; print('bpmn_to_ir' in w.__all__)\"` prints `False`; `python -c \"import rebar.llm.workflow.editor\"` exits 1 with `ModuleNotFoundError`.\n- [ ] `git ls-files src/rebar/llm/workflow/editor_assets tests/e2e | wc -l` prints `0`; `python -m build --wheel && unzip -l dist/*.whl | grep -c editor_assets` prints `0`.\n- [ ] `git grep -n -E 'e2e-deps|setup-node|editor_assets|REBAR_PREVIEW_TIMEOUT|prompt_authoring|criterion_preview' -- Makefile .github pyproject.toml src scripts tests ':!tests/fixtures'` prints nothing.\n- [ ] `python scripts/gen_cli_help.py --check && python scripts/gen_cli_reference.py --check && python scripts/gen_env_registry.py --check` exit 0; `grep -c REBAR_PREVIEW_TIMEOUT docs/env-vars.md` prints `0`.\n- [ ] `python -c \"from rebar.llm.prompting.prompt_library import _valid_id,_atomic_write; print(_valid_id('plan-review-G1G2'), _valid_id('a/b'))\"` prints `True False`; `pytest tests/unit/test_prompt_library_writes.py -q` passes.\n- [ ] `python scripts/check_complexity_baseline.py --check && python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check` exit 0 reporting `new=0 increased=0`.\n- [ ] `make verify` exits 0; the Gerrit change reaches `Verified +1` with no Node setup step in its run log."}},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1792360843509329770,"uuid":"2a4788af-9541-4a49-baae-e0604ec5508f"}